OL,3,GNEWSATeen's crash death 'unavoidable'-
OL,4,Acourt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crash which killed a North Yorkshire
OL,7,Fteenager was "unavoidable", a court has
OL,8,Fheard.
OL,10,FBailey Chadwick, 19, died when he was
OL,11,Fstruck by a vehicle on the B6265,
OL,12,Fbetween Pateley Bridge and Glasshouses,
OL,13,Fin the early hours of 20 July last
OL,14,Fyear.
OL,16,FOn Thursday driver Joseph Henry Stott
OL,17,Fappeared at Harrogate Magistrates'
OL,18,FCourt to plead guilty to a charge of
OL,19,Fdriving while unfit through drink on
OL,20,Fthe first day of his trial.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
