OL,3,GNEWSATeen's crash death 'unavoidable'-
OL,4,Acourt
OL,5,
OL,6,FFurther charges of failing to stop
OL,7,Fafter a crash and failing to report a
OL,8,Fcrash were dropped, after collision
OL,9,Fdata revealed Chadwick had been lying
OL,10,Fin the road playing music on his phone
OL,11,Fprior to the crash.
